# === secrets — NEVER commit (provided via GitHub Secrets in CI, .Renviron locally) ===
**/.Renviron
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/secrets.yml
**/config/secrets.yml
**/dk_session.txt
**/*.pem

# === heavy, rebuildable data (regenerated in CI or restored from actions/cache) ===
**/_targets/
**/data_cache/
**/node_modules/
**/.Rlib/
**/ownership_inbox/
**/*.duckdb
NFL/data/processed/*
NFL/data/raw/*
!NFL/data/raw/odds_api_line_movement/
# Frozen historical seed data (2021-2025 seasons, pre-2026 team games/schedules)
# plus a handful of build artifacts that nothing in nfl.yml ever regenerates.
# Static/rarely-rebuilt and read directly with no fallback by scripts 12/13/15/57,
# so they must be tracked or the nfl.yml "publish" job fails on every run
# (confirmed repeatedly: readRDS "cannot open the connection" on each of these).
!NFL/data/raw/player_stats_2021_2025.rds
!NFL/data/raw/team_games.rds
!NFL/data/raw/schedules.rds
!NFL/data/processed/game_features.rds
!NFL/data/processed/td_game_context.rds
!NFL/data/processed/td_deployment_model.rds
NFL/outputs/
dfs-engine/data/raw/
dfs-engine/data/reports/

